## 第二部分 美术资产 / Part 2: Visual Assets

**保留所有权利（All Rights Reserved）**

本部分涵盖但不限于：应用图标（`app-icon*.png`、`*.icns`、`*.iconset`）、界面截图、演示动图与视频、宣传图形、角色形象与吉祥物设计、界面视觉方案（配色、发光形态、状态灯布局等可识别外观）。

**美术资产不随第一部分源代码一并授权。** 即使你在第一部分获得源代码的某项权利，该权利也不包含对本部分任何资产的使用权。

This Part covers, without limitation: app icons, UI screenshots, demo animations and videos, promotional graphics, character and mascot designs, and the visual design language of the interface (color scheme, glow treatment, status-light layout, and other recognizable appearance).

**Visual assets are NOT licensed together with the source code in Part 1.** Any right obtained under Part 1 does not include any right to use any asset under this Part.

详细条款见 [`Assets/LICENSE`](Assets/LICENSE)。See [`Assets/LICENSE`](Assets/LICENSE) for the full terms.

