本仓库在 Tower Island（https://github.com/g535879/TowerIsland，MIT）基础上接管与重构。

- **源自上游的既有代码与资源**（含 `Sources/TowerIsland/Resources/` 下的图标资源）仍受 **MIT 许可证**约束，版权归原作者 guyubin、leeekyrie（Kunyang Lee）、greatbean/g535879 所有。本协议不改变、不缩减、不替代该 MIT 授权。
- 任何在 2026-08 许可调整之前依据 MIT 获得的授权**继续有效**，本协议无法撤销。
- 第三方依赖按其各自许可证授权，见 `Package.swift` 与 `Package.resolved`。
- 若本协议与上游 MIT 条款就同一材料冲突，就该材料适用 MIT。

This repository was taken over and refactored from Tower Island (https://github.com/g535879/TowerIsland, MIT).

- **Pre-existing code and resources originating from the upstream project** (including icon resources under `Sources/TowerIsland/Resources/`) remain under the **MIT License**, copyright guyubin, leeekyrie (Kunyang Lee), greatbean/g535879. This Agreement does not alter, reduce, or supersede that MIT grant.
- Any rights already granted under MIT prior to the 2026-08 license change **remain valid**; this Agreement cannot revoke them.
- Third-party dependencies are licensed under their respective terms; see `Package.swift` and `Package.resolved`.
- Where this Agreement conflicts with the upstream MIT terms regarding the same material, MIT governs for that material.

